--              : WARNING           Router BUS B Right channel warning
--              : WARNING.SILENT    Receiving silence
--              : WARNING.QUIET     Receiving Low level signal
--              : WARNING.NON_PCM   Non PCM signal detected
--              : WARNING.HIGH      Receiving High level signal
