---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Header		: BUS_CR
--
-- MIB ref		: swCardEventLogSlotXX       .6.66.85.83.95.67.82
-- absolute OID	: 1.3.6.1.4.1.7995.2.6.1.1.XX.6.66.85.83.95.67.82
