-- Header		: BUS_DR
--
-- MIB ref		: swCardEventLogSlotXX       .6.66.85.83.95.68.82
-- absolute OID	: 1.3.6.1.4.1.7995.2.6.1.1.XX.6.66.85.83.95.68.82
-- Vary			: YES
--
-- Value(s)		: OK                Router BUS D Right channel has valid signal selected
--              : WARNING           Router BUS D Right channel warning
--              : WARNING.SILENT    Receiving silence
